{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07718","headline":"自浔阳泛舟经明海 · 孟浩然","name":"自浔阳泛舟经明海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大江分九流，淼淼成水乡。\n舟子乘利涉，往来至浔阳。\n因之泛五湖，流浪经三湘。\n观涛壮枚发，吊屈痛沈湘。\n魏阙心恒在，金门诏不忘。\n遥怜上林雁，冰泮也回翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}